   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n",
   "originalText": "Full queue: put() blocks (backpressure).\nEmpty queue: take() blocks.\nNo busy waiting, no lost wakeups.",
